  "description_original": "Located in a quiet and scenic residential area between Tivat and Kotor, this cozy 24 m² apartment is thoughtfully designed to make the most of its space and natural light. Wake up to beautiful panoramic views of Tivat Bay and enjoy a relaxed coastal lifestyle away from the crowds.\nWhat you'll enjoy\nFurnished and ready to move in\n\nPanoramic views of Tivat Bay\n\nFunctional 1-bedroom layout\n\nBright, modern open-plan living space\n\nShared swimming pool within the residential complex\n\nDedicated parking space\n\nUtilities/bills included in the winter rental\n\nQuiet and peaceful residential environment\n\nKavac offers the ideal balance between tranquility and convenience. You're surrounded by nature and incredible views, while still being only a short drive from Tivat and Kotor.\n15 minutes to Tivat International Airport\n6 km to Porto Montenegro, with its marina, restaurants, cafés and shops\nEasy access to supermarkets, beaches and everyday essentials\nConvenient location for both Tivat and Kotor\nThis apartment is particularly suited to couples, digital nomads, remote professionals and expats looking for a comfortable home base during the winter months.\nWhether you're working remotely, escaping the cold, or simply looking for a peaceful few months on the Montenegrin coast, this apartment offers everything you need for a comfortable stay — with the added peace of mind that your regular bills are included.\nAvailable from October to 1 May 2027.",
